        "assertion": "The source and packaged imm-brainstorm and imm-planner contracts define the default exhaustive decision-tree protocol, complete-frontier rounds, repository-fact self-resolution, phase-specific decision ownership, zero-question fast path, recommendation/bulk acceptance behavior, result-only persistence, explicit final confirmation, and Planner-to-Brainstorm return for product-level uncertainty; the root bootstrap files satisfy the Managed Path markers and Project Context heading; the prior Brainstorm probing contract no longer enforces fixed question counts or one-at-a-time dependent probing.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.3.14\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/exhaustive-decision-tree-contract.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/brainstorm-decision-probing-contract.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 30000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 65536\n}\n"
      }
